<title>USA: Knape &amp; Vogt sets qtly dividends.</title>
<headline>Knape &amp; Vogt sets qtly dividends.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Knape &amp; Vogt Manufacturing Co said it declared a quarterly dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.165		    $0.165</p>
<p> Pay		    June 6</p>
<p> Record		 May 16</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>Knape &amp; Vogt Manufacturing Co said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class B common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.15		     $0.15</p>
<p> Pay		    June 6</p>
<p> Record		 May 16</p>
</text>
